            "DialogCategory": "UILobby",
            "VoiceClip": "Azusa_Season_Xmas",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_Azusa/Azusa_Season_Xmas",
            "LocalizeJP": "クリスマス……\n聖誕祭の日と言えば、\n一年の中でもかなり大切な日。\n\nこんな日に私なんかが\n一緒で良いのか……？",
            "LocalizeEN": "Christmas... A holy day, and one of the most important of the year.\n\nIs it really okay for someone like me to be with you like this today?"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10019,
            "DialogCategory": "UILobbySpecial",
            "VoiceClip": "Azusa_MemorialLobby_0_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_Azusa/Azusa_MemorialLobby_0_1",
            "LocalizeJP": "可愛いのは何も悪くないけど！\n\n可愛いぬいぐるみがいっぱいなのは良いけど！！\n\n……何だか恥ずかしい。",
            "LocalizeEN": "I guess they are kind of cute!\n\nI've never seen so many cute plushes! \n\nTh-This is so embarrassing..."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 10019,
            "DialogCategory": "UILobbySpecial",
            "VoiceClip": "Azusa_MemorialLobby_5_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_Azusa/Azusa_MemorialLobby_5_1",
            "LocalizeEN": "So where did you learn about this kind of place?\n\nYou saw it on a whim? I didn't expect you to like these sorts of things."
        },
